usage: sdle [-h] [--project-root PROJECT_ROOT] [--skill-root SKILL_ROOT]
            [--workitem WORKITEM] [--session SESSION]
            {lint-skill,init,header,resume,migrate,migrate-workflow,validate,config,governance,baseline,discovery,flow,workitem,state,retry,audit,advance,gate,drift,feature,security-review,artifact,limit,checkpoint,confirm,remediate,skip,restart,reset,doctor,accept-state,accept-content,repo-staleness,preflight,scan,clarify,guidance,implement,manifest,lock,sha,constants} ...

SDLE deterministic core. JSON on stdout, text on stderr.

positional arguments:
  {lint-skill,init,header,resume,migrate,migrate-workflow,validate,config,governance,baseline,discovery,flow,workitem,state,retry,audit,advance,gate,drift,feature,security-review,artifact,limit,checkpoint,confirm,remediate,skip,restart,reset,doctor,accept-state,accept-content,repo-staleness,preflight,scan,clarify,guidance,implement,manifest,lock,sha,constants}
    lint-skill          Verify cross-file sync rules.
    init                Create the WorkItem runtime and initial state.
    header              Render the status assertion header.
    resume              Everything a fresh session needs to pick a WorkItem up
                        (read-only).
    migrate             Apply the version migration chain.
    migrate-workflow    Move a legacy .workflow/ runtime under a WorkItem.
    validate            Check the WorkItem registry and runtime placement.
    config              Repository-level SDLE configuration.
    governance          Requirements quality, classification and risk.
    baseline            The repository baseline (contract §14). Read-only.
    discovery           Brownfield repository discovery (contract §14).
    flow                The bound lifecycle flow. Read-only.
    workitem            WorkItem identity.
    state               Read workflow state.
    retry               Guarded retry: refuses while drift re-approval is
                        pending.
    audit               Append-only audit ledger.
    advance             Move to the next phase.
    gate                Approval gates.
    drift               Artifact drift detection.
    feature             SpecKit feature directory.
    security-review     Phase 17 support.
    artifact            Artifact bookkeeping.
    limit               Rate limits and counters.
    checkpoint          In-phase crash recovery.
    confirm             Two-step confirmations.
    remediate           Post-rejection re-run.
    skip                Advance without a verified artifact.
    restart             Roll back to an earlier phase.
    reset               Delete all workflow state.
    doctor              Recovery consistency check.
    accept-state        Acknowledge a detected state jump.
    accept-content      Acknowledge flagged file content.
    repo-staleness      Commits newer than the newest approval.
    preflight           Bootstrap prerequisites.
    scan                Untrusted-content scan.
    clarify             Clarification responses.
    guidance            Per-phase steering files.
    implement           Phase 15 support.
    manifest            Gate 7 artifact.
    lock                Session lock.
    sha                 SHA-256 of a file (lowercase hex).
    constants           Dump the parsed constant tables.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --project-root PROJECT_ROOT
                        Target project (default: cwd).
  --skill-root SKILL_ROOT
                        Directory holding SKILL.md.
  --workitem WORKITEM   Active WorkItem id. Required when more than one is
                        registered.
  --session SESSION     Conversation session token; refreshes the WorkItem
                        lock on write.
